File Verification
-------------------

Create a simple Java application to:
Verify whether a particular file exists in your system or not.
If it exists, verify whether it is a directory file or a data file.
Verify whether the file is read-only or writable or both.
Print the file name and its path also.

StudentManagementSystem
--------------------------

You are asked to develop a sample Java application to manage student data called Student.txt as a collection of records.
Attributes for the student record are:
Rollno
Name
Age
M1
M2
M3
M4
M5
Grade
You should create a menu-driven application to perform CRUD operations on the student file.
Menu
1. Add Records
2. Read All Records
3. Read Record on Roll No
4. Read Record on Name
5. Delete Record on Roll No
6. Update Record on Roll No, Name, Age
7. Exit